# DESK05 run A -- Options -> Desktop configuration..., step the shortcut list,
# Clear all, then Cancel; the File drop-down before and after proves
# `recover_shortcuts` put the array back.
#
#   Options drop-down: box at x=160, entries 16 px tall from y=19.
#     entry 0 "Set background..."       19..35
#     entry 7 "Desktop configuration..." 131..147  centre 139
#   File title centre ~ (88, 8); Options title centre ~ (196, 8)
#   (" Desk " spans 16..64, " File " 64..112).
#
#   ADDESKCF (NewTOS build): ROOT 312x288, form_center -> (164,105).
#     DCMNUCLR  rel(8+140, 142+32) -> abs (312,279) 152x16  centre (388,287)
#     DCMNUNXT  rel(272,120)       -> abs (436,225)  32x16  centre (452,233)
#     DC_CNCL   rel(184,256)       -> abs (348,361)  72x16  centre (384,369)
#     DCOK      rel( 56,256)       -> abs (220,361)  72x16  centre (256,369)
